<title>POLAND: Jutrzenka Q2 net rises to PLN 3.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Jutrzenka Q2 net rises to PLN 3.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jutrzenka preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.64 vs	2.28</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   5.24 vs	1.57</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.53 vs	1.04</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Przesiebiorstwo Cukiernicze Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 33.50 vs     24.27</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  25.02 vs     18.93</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.70 vs	0.52</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.38 vs	0.06</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.79 vs	0.77</p>
<p>    investment				18.70 vs	0.29</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			10.33 vs	7.60</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  11.52 vs	6.55</p>
<p>    net profit				 7.86 vs	4.35</p>
<p>    net sales				 70.29 vs     54.35</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  51.64 vs     40.54</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.65 vs	2.20</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.45 vs	0.13</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.26 vs	1.18</p>
<p>    investment				20.98 vs	2.84</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
